## User

Run-length encode a list: each maximal run of equal elements becomes the element and the length of the run.

## Type

type
```haskell
rle :: Eq a => [a] -> [(a, Int)]
```

## Term

```haskell
rle = go []
  where
    go acc [] = acc
    go acc (x:xs) = go (x:acc) xs
```

